#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/hqx_interpolator.rst:48
msgid ""
"This effect/filter works best for pixel art. Scaling is done by a factor of "
"2, 3, or 4 using the Hq*X\\ [1]_ magnification algorithm specifically "
"designed for this."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter funguje najlepšie pre pixel art. Mierkovanie sa vykonáva "
"faktorom 2, 3 alebo 4 pomocou algoritmu zvýraznenia Hq*X\\ [1]_ špeciálne "
"navrhnutého na tento účel."

